---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>Amateur Golf Challenge</h2>

  <p>
    Amateur Golf Challenge is a dynamic, cross-platform mobile application
    designed for amateur golfers in Australia to participate in competitions.
    The app empowers users to register for tournaments, track their scores in
    real-time, and engage with a vibrant golfing community.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: Amateur Golf Challenge PTY LTD <br />
    Role: Sr. Mobile Developer <br />
    Period: October 2021 – November 2022
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Mobile Development:</strong> Developed entirely in
      <strong>React Native</strong> to provide a native-like experience on both iOS
      and Android platforms.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Backend Integration:</strong> Collaborated with a backend developer
      to integrate robust, secure RESTful API endpoints for user authentication, score
      tracking, and real-time updates.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>UI/UX Design:</strong> Worked closely with a designer to translate Figma
      mockups into a sleek, intuitive, and engaging user interface.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> Defined core features and
      user flows, focusing on the needs of amateur golfers.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Implementation:</strong> Built the mobile application using React Native,
      ensuring fast performance and seamless cross-platform functionality.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Collaboration:</strong> Coordinated with a backend developer for API
      integration and with a designer to maintain a high-quality UI/UX.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Testing & Maintenance:</strong> Conducted thorough testing and maintained
      app versions to deliver a reliable and bug-free experience.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">Key Skill: React Native, Figma.</p>

  <p>
    Amateur Golf Challenge stands as a testament to my ability to create
    engaging, high-performance mobile applications using modern technologies. By
    developing a cross-platform app with React Native and collaborating closely
    with a backend developer and a designer, I ensured an intuitive and robust
    user experience tailored for amateur golfers. This project highlights my
    proficiency in mobile development, my commitment to seamless teamwork, and
    my focus on delivering user-centric solutions that meet real-world needs.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://www.playagc.com/"
    target="_blank">Project website</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
